          <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; border-left: 0px; border-right: 0px; border-top: 1px solid #000000; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top">
                        <p class="CellBody">An open space available for informal activities. A Pocket Park shall provide smaller open spaces in close proximity to neighborhood residences.</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; border-left: 0px; border-right: 0px; border-top: 1px solid #000000; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top">
                        <p class="CellBody">An open space designed and equipped for the recreation of children. A Playground should be fenced and may include an open shelter. Playgrounds may be included within Parks and Greens.</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; border-left: 0px; border-right: 0px; border-top: 1px solid #000000; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top">
                        <p class="CellBody">An open space designed as a grouping of garden plots that are available to nearby residents for small-scale cultivation. Community Gardens may be included within Parks and Greens.</p>

          </td>
        </tr>
